{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790379123687,"sessionID":"ses_f251709e6ffe6ruf2voOHjkOD4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_TPXEFKOvPTGmdjsHexivRYAa","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd"},"output":"<path>/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: extends CardState\n2: \n3: const MOUSE_Y_SNAPBACK_THRESHOLD := 138\n4: \n5: \n6: func enter() -> void:\n7: \tcard_ui.targets.clear()\n8: \tvar offset := Vector2(card_ui.parent.size.x / 2, -card_ui.size.y / 2)\n9: \toffset.x -= card_ui.size.x / 2\n10: \tcard_ui.animate_to_position(card_ui.parent.global_position + offset, 0.2)\n11: \tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = false\n12: \tEvents.card_aim_started.emit(card_ui)\n13: \n14: \n15: func exit() -> void:\n16: \tEvents.card_aim_ended.emit(card_ui)\n17: \n18: \n19: func on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\t\n20: \tvar mouse_motion := event is InputEventMouseMotion\n21: \tvar mouse_at_bottom := card_ui.get_global_mouse_position().y > MOUSE_Y_SNAPBACK_THRESHOLD\n22: \t\n23: \tif (mouse_motion and mouse_at_bottom) or event.is_action_pressed(\"right_mouse\"):\n24: \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.BASE)\n25: \telif event.is_action_released(\"left_mouse\") or event.is_action_pressed(\"left_mouse\"):\n26: \t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n27: \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.RELEASED)\n\n(End of file - total 27 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"extends CardState\n\nconst MOUSE_Y_SNAPBACK_THRESHOLD := 138\n\n\nfunc enter() -> void:\n\tcard_ui.targets.clear()\n\tvar offset := Vector2(card_ui.parent.size.x / 2, -card_ui.size.y / 2)\n\toffset.x -= card_ui.size.x / 2\n\tcard_ui.animate_to_position(card_ui.parent.global_position + offset, 0.2)\n\tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = false\n\tEvents.card_aim_started.emit(card_ui)\n\n\nfunc exit() -> void:\n\tEvents.card_aim_ended.emit(card_ui)\n\n\nfunc on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\t\n\tvar mouse_motion := event is InputEventMouseMotion","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd","text":"extends CardState\n\nconst MOUSE_Y_SNAPBACK_THRESHOLD := 138\n\n\nfunc enter() -> void:\n\tcard_ui.targets.clear()\n\tvar offset := Vector2(card_ui.parent.size.x / 2, -card_ui.size.y / 2)\n\toffset.x -= card_ui.size.x / 2\n\tcard_ui.animate_to_position(card_ui.parent.global_position + offset, 0.2)\n\tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = false\n\tEvents.card_aim_started.emit(card_ui)\n\n\nfunc exit() -> void:\n\tEvents.card_aim_ended.emit(card_ui)\n\n\nfunc on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\t\n\tvar mouse_motion := event is InputEventMouseMotion\n\tvar mouse_at_bottom := card_ui.get_global_mouse_position().y > MOUSE_Y_SNAPBACK_THRESHOLD\n\t\n\tif (mouse_motion and mouse_at_bottom) or event.is_action_pressed(\"right_mouse\"):\n\t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.BASE)\n\telif event.is_action_released(\"left_mouse\") or event.is_action_pressed(\"left_mouse\"):\n\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n\t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.RELEASED)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":27,"totalLines":27,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd","time":{"start":1790379123657,"end":1790379123685}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_005246936452116a016ab704735c9c819590772473f4ef9763"}},"id":"prt_0dae963c7001vzbKbyVny16aPN","sessionID":"ses_f251709e6ffe6ruf2voOHjkOD4","messageID":"msg_0dae94609001V061UAkG1ITYQ3"}}
