{"type":"text","timestamp":1790379141208,"sessionID":"ses_f251709e6ffe6ruf2voOHjkOD4","part":{"id":"prt_0dae9a83b001YvI5smEUls5RuG","messageID":"msg_0dae964d0001sy6YgyGpc86aGs","sessionID":"ses_f251709e6ffe6ruf2voOHjkOD4","type":"text","text":"The harness’s state scripts and input callbacks are stubs. I’ll wire them through the existing nodes, restore cancelled cards through `Palm`’s signal handler, and measure the 45 ms release threshold from the start of each drag.\n","time":{"start":1790379141179,"end":1790379141183},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_005246936452116a016ab7048346248195a72f31387651605d","phase":"commentary"}}}}
