{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790379285012,"sessionID":"ses_f251709e6ffe6ruf2voOHjkOD4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_sDYQzfCLZwSIGYnGuHI8Cqia","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd\n@@\n extends \"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\"\n \n+var played := false\n+\n \n func enter() -> void:\n \tcard_ui.state_label.text = \"Released\"\n-\tif not card_ui.targets.is_empty():\n+\tplayed = not card_ui.targets.is_empty()\n+\tif played:\n \t\tcard_ui.play()\n@@\n func on_input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tif card_ui.targets.is_empty():\n+\tif not played:\n \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, State.BASE)\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/card_drag_verification.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+const State = preload(\"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\").State\n+\n+var failures := 0\n+var mouse_position := Vector2.ZERO\n+var buttons := 0\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _check(condition: bool, message: String) -> void:\n+\tif not condition:\n+\t\tfailures += 1\n+\t\tpush_error(message)\n+\n+\n+func _motion(position: Vector2) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n+\tevent.position = root.get_final_transform() * position\n+\tevent.global_position = event.position\n+\tevent.relative = event.position - mouse_position\n+\tevent.button_mask = buttons\n+\tmouse_position = event.position\n+\tInput.parse_input_event(event)\n+\tInput.flush_buffered_events()\n+\n+\n+func _button(button: MouseButton, pressed: bool) -> void:\n+\tvar mask := 1 << (button - 1)\n+\tif pressed:\n+\t\tbuttons |= mask\n+\telse:\n+\t\tbuttons &= ~mask\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseButton.new()\n+\tevent.button_index = button\n+\tevent.pressed = pressed\n+\tevent.position = mouse_position\n+\tevent.global_position = mouse_position\n+\tevent.button_mask = buttons\n+\tInput.parse_input_event(event)\n+\tInput.flush_buffered_events()\n+\n+\n+func _settle() -> void:\n+\tfor frame in range(4):\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\t\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\n+func _snapshot(name: String) -> void:\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\tvar image := root.get_texture().get_image()\n+\t_check(image.save_png(\"res://.godot/\" + name + \".png\") == OK, \"Save screenshot \" + name)\n+\n+\n+func _run() -> void:\n+\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tcurrent_scene = scene\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\tvar palm = scene.get_node(\"ArenaUI/Palm\")\n+\tvar layer = scene.get_node(\"ArenaUI\")\n+\tvar zone = scene.get_node(\"ReleaseZone\")\n+\tvar cards = palm.get_children()\n+\t_check(cards.size() == 3, \"Harness starts with three cards\")\n+\tfor card in cards:\n+\t\tvar machine = card.card_state_machine\n+\t\t_check(machine.current_state == machine.initial_state, \"Initial state is active\")\n+\t\t_check(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Base disables monitoring\")\n+\t\tfor state in machine.get_children():\n+\t\t\t_check(state.card_ui == card, \"Every state is initialized\")\n+\t\t\t_check(state.transition_requested.is_connected(machine._on_transition_requested), \"Every transition signal is connected\")\n+\tawait _snapshot(\"cards_initial\")\n+\tvar card = cards[1]\n+\tvar machine = card.card_state_machine\n+\tmachine.get_node(\"CardClickedState\").transition_requested.emit(machine.get_node(\"CardClickedState\"), State.DRAGGING)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.BASE, \"Inactive state cannot transition\")\n+\tmachine.current_state.transition_requested.emit(machine.current_state, 99)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.BASE, \"Unknown state is ignored\")\n+\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(zone)\n+\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(zone)\n+\t_check(card.targets.size() == 1, \"Repeated area entry is deduplicated\")\n+\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_exited(zone)\n+\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_exited(zone)\n+\t_check(card.targets.is_empty(), \"Repeated area exit is harmless\")\n+\n+\t# GUI click and global mouse motion exercise the actual input callbacks.\n+\tvar grab_offset := Vector2(10, 10)\n+\t_motion(card.global_position + grab_offset)\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.CLICKED, \"GUI left click selects the card\")\n+\t_check(card.original_index == 1, \"Click records its Palm index\")\n+\t_check(card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Click enables monitoring\")\n+\t_motion(Vector2(130, 105))\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.DRAGGING, \"Mouse motion begins dragging\")\n+\t_check(card.get_parent() == layer, \"Drag reparents to screen_layer group node\")\n+\t_check(card.global_position.is_equal_approx(Vector2(130, 105) - grab_offset), \"Card follows the mouse without jumping\")\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.DRAGGING, \"Release before 45 ms is ignored\")\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_motion(Vector2(170, 60))\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(card.global_position.is_equal_approx(Vector2(170, 60) - grab_offset), \"Subsequent mouse motion follows the pointer\")\n+\t_check(card.targets.has(zone), \"Physics detects entry into the drop area\")\n+\tawait _snapshot(\"cards_dragging\")\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, true)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.BASE, \"Right click cancels\")\n+\t_check(card.get_parent() == palm and card.get_index() == 1, \"Cancel restores the recorded index in Palm\")\n+\t_check(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring and card.targets.is_empty(), \"Cancel resets detection and targets\")\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, false)\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(palm.get_children() == cards, \"Cancel preserves original card order\")\n+\tawait _snapshot(\"cards_cancelled\")\n+\n+\t# A release outside a target remains released until the next input.\n+\t_motion(card.global_position + grab_offset)\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\t_motion(Vector2(130, 108))\n+\tawait create_timer(0.06).timeout\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(card.targets.is_empty(), \"Drag outside the drop area has no targets\")\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.RELEASED, \"Release after 45 ms is confirmed\")\n+\t_check(not card.is_queued_for_deletion(), \"Invalid drop retains the card\")\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.RELEASED, \"Invalid release waits for input\")\n+\t_motion(Vector2(135, 108))\n+\t_check(machine.current_state.state == State.BASE, \"Next input restores an invalid drop\")\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(palm.get_children() == cards, \"Invalid drop restores card order\")\n+\n+\t# Confirm target exit, re-entry, and successful removal using actual physics.\n+\t_motion(card.global_position + grab_offset)\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\t_motion(Vector2(130, 50))\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(card.targets.has(zone), \"New drag detects a target\")\n+\t_motion(Vector2(130, 108))\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(card.targets.is_empty(), \"Leaving the area clears the target\")\n+\t_motion(Vector2(130, 50))\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\t_check(card.is_queued_for_deletion(), \"Valid release immediately queues removal\")\n+\tawait _settle()\n+\t_check(not is_instance_valid(card), \"Played card is removed\")\n+\t_check(palm.get_child_count() == 2, \"Two cards remain after playing one\")\n+\tawait _snapshot(\"cards_played\")\n+\n+\t# Simple click/release does not leave a card stuck in the clicked state.\n+\tvar remaining = palm.get_child(0)\n+\t_motion(remaining.global_position + grab_offset)\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\t_button(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\t_check(remaining.card_state_machine.current_state.state == State.BASE, \"Click without motion returns to base\")\n+\t_check(not remaining.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Click without motion resets monitoring\")\n+\tprint(\"Card drag verification finished: %d failures\" % failures)\n+\tquit(1 if failures else 0)\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd\nA workspace/.godot/card_drag_verification.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd\n+++ /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd\n@@ -1,12 +1,15 @@\n extends \"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\"\n \n+var played := false\n \n+\n func enter() -> void:\n \tcard_ui.state_label.text = \"Released\"\n-\tif not card_ui.targets.is_empty():\n+\tplayed = not card_ui.targets.is_empty()\n+\tif played:\n \t\tcard_ui.play()\n \n \n func on_input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tif card_ui.targets.is_empty():\n+\tif not played:\n \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, State.BASE)\n\nIndex: /workspace/.godot/card_drag_verification.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/card_drag_verification.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/card_drag_verification.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,161 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+const State = preload(\"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\").State\n+\n+var failures := 0\n+var mouse_position := Vector2.ZERO\n+var buttons := 0\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func _check(condition: bool, message: String) -> void:\n+\tif not condition:\n+\t\tfailures += 1\n+\t\tpush_error(message)\n+\n+\n+func _motion(position: Vector2) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n+\tevent.position = root.get_final_transform() * position\n+\tevent.global_position = event.position\n+\tevent.relative = event.position - mouse_position\n+\tevent.button_mask = buttons\n+\tmouse_position = event.position\n+\tInput.parse_input